    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trĭplĭcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id. (post-class.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a tripling</i> or <i>trebling</i>,
				<i>triplication.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.,
					<i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 20 <i>med.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart.
				Cap. 7, § 750</span></i>; Firm. Math. 2, 26 <i>fin.</i> al.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., in jurid. Lat., <i>a surrejoinder</i>, <i>triplication</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 27, 10, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just.
				Inst. 4, 14, 2</span></i>.</div>
